al in November to December 40 times since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle ran 200% of normal in June to July and 20% in November to December. In 2026 so far it shows 19% in February to March and 113% in May to June. All 4 grids had their driest year in 2012, at 49% or 50% of normal.</p>"}
